# Milestone: M6 Wave 2
# Covers: Phase 8 (T91) CallMessage stub proto.
#
# CallMessage is reserved at v1.0 per REVIVAL §14 L14 — the legacy Urbi
# 2.x fallback() reflection mechanism that exposes the calling context
# as a first-class object.  The proto is bound as a realm global so
# scripts can pattern-match on its presence; method surface (.target /
# .method / .args / .apply()) lands at v1.x when fallback() lex/parse
# support arrives.
#
# At v1.0 only a `kind` marker slot is exposed.

# CallMessage exists as a realm global.
CallMessage.kind
[00000000] "callmessage"
